WEBVTT

00:24.896 --> 00:28.000
♪I woke up in a strange place♪

00:31.123 --> 00:34.080
♪The sunlight here is blindingly bright♪

00:37.216 --> 00:40.736
♪Pages rustle, and I hear a loud voice♪

00:42.656 --> 00:47.712
♪I've become the center of the story♪

00:48.608 --> 00:52.978
♪I must escape this dream♪

00:54.560 --> 00:59.160
♪Yet why does my heart
surrender before you♪

01:00.128 --> 01:04.032
♪Clearly, it's a fake plot♪

01:04.352 --> 01:06.528
♪A fake world♪

01:07.232 --> 01:12.224
♪Yet eventually,
my heart is open to you♪

01:37.088 --> 01:40.896
=My Page in the 90s=
(Adapted from "Bye, Wild Weasel")

01:41.255 --> 01:43.979
=Episode 24=

01:50.024 --> 01:51.264
Let's do a quick survey.

01:52.425 --> 01:52.985
Sure.

01:54.625 --> 01:57.865
On weekends, do you prefer
climbing mountain or sleeping in?

01:59.345 --> 02:00.865
Sleeping in on the mountain.

02:03.024 --> 02:03.585
Okay.

02:06.104 --> 02:07.104
For anniversary,

02:07.664 --> 02:10.225
do you prefer a handwritten love letter

02:10.664 --> 02:13.104
or a romantic trip for two?

02:14.625 --> 02:17.465
During the romantic trip for two,

02:17.465 --> 02:18.584
you give me a love letter.

02:20.144 --> 02:25.824
Okay. Then do you prefer walking
with an umbrella on rainy days

02:25.824 --> 02:28.144
or biking on sunny days?

02:30.384 --> 02:32.945
You ride the motorcycle with me on it,

02:33.144 --> 02:34.104
and I hold the umbrella.

02:34.785 --> 02:35.704
Rain or shine,

02:35.864 --> 02:36.664
nothing stops us.

02:37.984 --> 02:39.704
I didn't expect you to be so greedy.

02:40.104 --> 02:41.664
It's too late for you to know that now.

02:50.664 --> 02:52.185
These wontons are so delicious.

02:52.185 --> 02:53.864
What if I can't eat them in the future?

03:04.025 --> 03:04.745
Just a moment.

03:05.025 --> 03:05.704
What's wrong?

03:05.824 --> 03:06.544
Just a moment.

03:10.584 --> 03:11.785
Sir, Mr. Jin.

03:12.984 --> 03:15.424
I'd like to learn
how to make wontons from you.

03:15.424 --> 03:18.584
Please teach me the secret recipe,
so I can make it for my girlfriend.

03:18.864 --> 03:19.704
Okay, sure.

03:19.905 --> 03:20.905
- Okay. Come on.
- Okay.

03:21.025 --> 03:21.864
- I'll teach you.
- Thank you.

03:21.905 --> 03:22.984
Look, just like this.

03:25.544 --> 03:29.512
♪Old times, pass slowly♪

03:29.512 --> 03:33.642
♪In memories, the breeze is soft♪

03:34.280 --> 03:38.250
♪Your smile is shimmering like stars♪

03:38.250 --> 03:43.666
♪Lighting up my lonely corner♪

03:44.886 --> 03:51.336
♪Love's time machine,
flies, flies, flies♪

03:51.336 --> 03:53.832
(Wonton Recipe)

03:53.832 --> 04:00.454
♪Through centuries, just to meet you♪

04:00.454 --> 04:08.455
♪Love's time machine keeps on turning♪

04:08.455 --> 04:12.808
♪Streaking across the sky♪

04:13.704 --> 04:22.600
♪Just to hold you♪

04:32.168 --> 04:36.136
♪Old times, pass slowly♪

04:36.136 --> 04:39.904
♪In memories, the breeze is soft♪

04:39.904 --> 04:40.464
Try it.

04:41.264 --> 04:42.024
I made it myself.

04:43.784 --> 04:44.584
This has gone cold.

04:45.185 --> 04:45.945
Careful, it's hot.

04:51.985 --> 04:52.745
Careful, it's hot.

04:54.264 --> 04:54.865
How is it?

04:57.665 --> 04:58.185
Delicious?

05:01.945 --> 05:04.105
Why does it taste exactly the same
as Mr. Jin's?

05:05.024 --> 05:06.464
Seems like I've succeeded.

05:09.505 --> 05:10.745
This wonton place

05:11.105 --> 05:12.384
looks ordinary,

05:12.384 --> 05:13.464
and with nothing special.

05:14.144 --> 05:15.865
Why is their food so delicious?

05:16.505 --> 05:17.665
Any secret recipe?

05:22.425 --> 05:23.264
This is the recipe.

05:23.425 --> 05:24.648
But you can't read it now.

05:25.024 --> 05:26.384
Read it when the time comes.

05:27.464 --> 05:28.745
Here, keep it.

05:30.105 --> 05:30.704
Remember

05:30.704 --> 05:32.224
when we had wonton for the first time,

05:32.584 --> 05:34.440
you hired someone
to secretly take photos of us

05:34.584 --> 05:36.024
and pretended to wipe my mouth?

05:42.584 --> 05:45.224
I've kept that magazine.

05:48.505 --> 05:49.224
Gao Haiming.

05:50.384 --> 05:53.865
Actually, before I met you,

05:53.865 --> 05:55.745
I couldn't understand
people in love at all.

05:56.464 --> 05:58.305
They seemed so retarded.

05:59.224 --> 06:02.144
Just because they did some boring

06:02.144 --> 06:03.305
trivial things together,

06:03.745 --> 06:05.832
they would giggle like fools
when thinking of them.

06:08.745 --> 06:11.505
But now, whenever I think
of the time I spent with you,

06:12.784 --> 06:14.065
I'd do the same.

06:20.105 --> 06:21.745
All the memories we have together

06:23.344 --> 06:24.545
are all in my mind.

06:30.344 --> 06:32.904
Even if we never see each other again,

06:33.945 --> 06:34.985
I'd have no regret.

06:37.305 --> 06:37.904
What?

06:40.745 --> 06:41.505
Nothing.

06:42.704 --> 06:43.384
Nothing.

06:45.625 --> 06:47.505
I remember
there's an amusement park nearby.

06:47.665 --> 06:48.464
Want to go?

06:48.945 --> 06:51.264
Now? It's too late now, right?

06:51.264 --> 06:52.584
We couldn't play anything then.

06:53.305 --> 06:55.065
If we set off now, we'll make it.
Let's go.

06:55.464 --> 06:55.985
Now?

06:55.985 --> 06:57.865
Let's go.

07:07.904 --> 07:11.464
It's so dark here. How can we play?

07:12.024 --> 07:12.784
Wait for me.

07:22.144 --> 07:23.185
No way.

07:25.144 --> 07:26.625
Does it look like what you mentioned?

07:26.625 --> 07:27.625
What was it called?

07:27.945 --> 07:28.665
Old-style?

07:31.105 --> 07:32.425
Never mind it.

07:32.985 --> 07:33.865
It's so cool.

07:34.904 --> 07:35.505
Which one?

07:36.505 --> 07:37.505
Let's play them all.

07:37.584 --> 07:38.384
Okay, let's go.

08:19.545 --> 08:20.704
What is this?

08:22.224 --> 08:25.344
I always thought amusement parks
were only for kids,

08:25.425 --> 08:27.224
but I didn't expect
to have so much fun here.

08:27.945 --> 08:31.185
Right. It's my first time
at an amusement park.

08:31.945 --> 08:32.785
I'm really happy.

08:34.104 --> 08:35.744
You've never been to an amusement park?

08:37.545 --> 08:39.185
Then you've never ridden a carousel?

08:39.425 --> 08:39.945
No.

08:40.504 --> 08:42.624
You've never ridden a carousel?

08:44.945 --> 08:47.104
How could you?

08:51.185 --> 08:52.624
Would you get dizzy on this?

08:53.945 --> 08:54.905
No.

08:54.905 --> 08:56.905
How could I get dizzy on this?

08:59.785 --> 09:01.185
But if I do feel dizzy,

09:01.464 --> 09:02.344
hold me steady.

09:08.385 --> 09:09.864
When I rode carousels as a kid,

09:10.065 --> 09:11.104
I thought they were slow.

09:12.104 --> 09:13.744
And I wished they'd go much faster.

09:16.265 --> 09:17.185
What about now?

09:19.185 --> 09:20.104
Now...

09:22.104 --> 09:23.665
Now I think slowing down is good.

09:25.425 --> 09:26.224
Slowing down

09:28.224 --> 09:29.704
lets me see clearly those around me

09:31.905 --> 09:33.744
and truly feel this present moment.

09:39.624 --> 09:42.065
I used to make wishes
on carousels as a child.

09:43.065 --> 09:44.665
Make wishes on carousels?

09:46.744 --> 09:48.104
When my parents brought me here,

09:48.104 --> 09:49.265
I'd ride the carousel

09:49.624 --> 09:50.945
and make a wish.

09:51.305 --> 09:54.464
I wish to get a new toy
from my parents the next day,

09:55.385 --> 09:57.945
or to get better in my exams.

10:02.584 --> 10:05.104
Then, any wishes now?

10:11.864 --> 10:12.864
Now,

10:16.464 --> 10:17.305
I wish...

10:17.545 --> 10:19.945
Wait, you need to make wishes sincerely.

10:21.744 --> 10:22.504
Close your eyes.

10:52.305 --> 10:53.025
Huan'er.

10:54.545 --> 10:58.305
Though we've not been together for long,

11:02.504 --> 11:03.624
we've shared many moments

11:04.824 --> 11:06.145
that are unforgettable.

11:09.665 --> 11:13.504
So, will you marry me

11:16.624 --> 11:17.744
and spend your life with me?

11:24.065 --> 11:25.065
But my life...

11:25.545 --> 11:26.185
Huan'er.

11:28.344 --> 11:29.065
Doesn't matter.

11:32.864 --> 11:34.185
Whether it's a lifetime,

11:36.945 --> 11:37.744
a day,

11:39.704 --> 11:41.624
or even one minute, one second,

11:42.785 --> 11:43.945
as long as I'm with you,

11:46.984 --> 11:48.065
that makes my whole life.

11:59.104 --> 11:59.864
Do you?

12:03.665 --> 12:04.305
I...

12:08.545 --> 12:09.305
I do.

12:14.344 --> 12:16.744
Gao Haiming, I do.

12:44.104 --> 12:47.087
♪Entwined worries linger♪

12:48.296 --> 12:51.067
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

12:52.968 --> 12:58.881
♪Now I see what passed between us♪

13:00.678 --> 13:03.738
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

13:04.904 --> 13:08.356
♪Going through surging tides of people♪

13:09.352 --> 13:14.878
♪Until the world's end♪

13:17.288 --> 13:21.084
♪If I could♪

13:21.672 --> 13:24.488
♪Keep loving you♪

13:25.512 --> 13:27.912
♪Hearing two hearts♪

13:27.912 --> 13:32.828
♪Beating together♪

13:33.800 --> 13:37.664
♪If I could♪

13:37.664 --> 13:40.904
♪Stay resting in your arms♪

13:41.960 --> 13:49.285
♪I'd trade the rest of my life for it♪

14:22.145 --> 14:22.824
I love you.

14:35.864 --> 14:36.704
Huan'er.

14:38.065 --> 14:39.504
Huan'er, wake up.

14:42.704 --> 14:43.945
What's wrong, Huan'er?

14:44.265 --> 14:45.425
- Huan'er.
- Huan'er.

14:45.425 --> 14:46.344
Are you okay?

14:50.425 --> 14:51.584
Are you okay? Too tired?

14:51.584 --> 14:52.744
- What happened?
- Huan'er.

14:52.744 --> 14:54.065
The live stream starts soon.

14:54.065 --> 14:55.224
You need touch-ups.

14:57.545 --> 14:59.504
Huan'er, what's going on?

14:59.824 --> 15:00.504
So,

15:01.984 --> 15:03.344
will you marry me

15:04.624 --> 15:05.744
and spend your life with me?

15:06.425 --> 15:08.945
Gao Haiming, I do.

15:38.104 --> 15:38.864
Huan'er.

15:39.104 --> 15:39.984
Huan'er.

15:40.584 --> 15:42.545
Huan'er, what's wrong?

15:42.665 --> 15:44.385
The upcoming live streams are crucial.

15:44.504 --> 15:45.864
We have to win the challenge.

15:46.425 --> 15:47.265
Huan'er!

15:50.504 --> 15:52.545
Has a man named Gao Haiming
come to the company?

15:52.984 --> 15:54.344
There's no such person.

15:55.145 --> 15:55.945
Oh my.

15:55.945 --> 15:57.464
Only fifteen minutes to go.

15:57.864 --> 15:59.185
If we don't go back now,

15:59.185 --> 16:00.665
Mr. Zeng will kill us!

16:00.945 --> 16:02.385
Why is there no such person?

16:02.504 --> 16:03.545
Gao Haiming!

16:03.665 --> 16:05.265
Sanitary pads, no.

16:07.504 --> 16:09.305
Gao Haiming came to our office

16:09.504 --> 16:10.425
to acquire our company.

16:10.425 --> 16:11.305
Don't you remember?

16:11.744 --> 16:12.864
Did I agree to it?

16:18.305 --> 16:19.984
Someone wants to acquire our company?

16:21.025 --> 16:21.584
Who?

16:22.265 --> 16:24.344
Mr. Gao Haiming. Haven't you met him?

16:27.065 --> 16:28.065
Mr. Gao?

16:28.305 --> 16:29.305
I've never heard of

16:29.305 --> 16:30.504
anyone named Gao Haiming.

16:32.584 --> 16:33.265
Mr. Zeng.

16:33.744 --> 16:36.104
Huan'er might not be feeling well today.

16:36.545 --> 16:37.744
Not feeling well?

16:39.025 --> 16:40.504
I think you've lost your mind.

16:40.504 --> 16:42.185
How is that possible?

16:42.504 --> 16:43.824
You scheduled to meet with him.

16:46.984 --> 16:47.945
What's today's date?

16:49.065 --> 16:50.464
February 16th, Huan'er.

16:51.065 --> 16:52.945
You've lost track of time?

16:54.385 --> 16:56.145
(The first time meeting Gao Haiming)

16:56.665 --> 16:58.185
(should be February 28th.)

16:58.945 --> 17:00.744
(Why did I come back to February 16th?)

17:01.305 --> 17:02.545
If you're not feeling well,

17:02.545 --> 17:04.385
you can cancel the live stream.
Understood?

17:05.425 --> 17:06.064
Cancel it.

17:11.825 --> 17:12.425
Impossible.

17:14.865 --> 17:16.145
He has to be in this world.

17:17.825 --> 17:18.385
Huan'er.

17:18.504 --> 17:19.544
Where are you going?

17:19.744 --> 17:20.504
Huan'er!

17:24.200 --> 17:25.512
(Gao Haiming)

17:27.272 --> 17:28.744
(Gao Haiming, not found)

17:30.322 --> 17:31.991
(Xinning South Road)

17:32.264 --> 17:34.825
Sir, go to North Boyang Road first.

17:34.825 --> 17:35.264
Okay.

17:43.185 --> 17:43.825
Excuse me.

17:44.224 --> 17:45.865
Was this area a villa district before?

17:45.865 --> 17:46.544
Right here.

17:46.945 --> 17:47.665
Never heard of it.

17:49.185 --> 17:49.784
Excuse me.

17:50.064 --> 17:50.945
May I ask

17:50.945 --> 17:52.264
if this place was Letao?

17:53.464 --> 17:54.264
A supermarket?

17:54.744 --> 17:55.385
No.

17:56.264 --> 17:57.064
It's fine, thanks.

19:15.264 --> 19:18.425
You are just too fixated
on reaching a destination

19:18.905 --> 19:20.425
and miss the views along the way.

19:20.784 --> 19:22.024
Isn't it an even bigger shame?

19:22.504 --> 19:24.264
You always seem so emotionally stable.

19:24.464 --> 19:25.825
It's not that I'm stable.

19:25.825 --> 19:26.945
You're always in a hurry.

19:28.945 --> 19:30.665
You're in a hurry to find a place,

19:30.784 --> 19:32.264
to solve a problem,

19:32.504 --> 19:33.865
and to finish a task.

19:34.264 --> 19:35.464
Why are you in such a rush?

19:36.665 --> 19:38.905
Sometimes, wasting time
can be a kind of joy too.

19:39.425 --> 19:40.145
Try it.

19:43.336 --> 19:46.792
♪My heart is pounding♪

19:46.792 --> 19:50.760
♪Old times, pass slowly♪.

19:50.760 --> 19:54.890
♪In memories, the breeze is soft♪

19:55.528 --> 19:59.498
♪Your smile is shimmering like stars♪

19:59.498 --> 20:04.914
♪Lighting up my lonely corner♪.

20:06.134 --> 20:13.688
♪Love's time machine,
flies, flies, flies♪

20:13.688 --> 20:21.702
♪Through centuries, just to meet you♪.

20:21.702 --> 20:29.703
♪Love's time machine keeps on turning♪.

20:29.703 --> 20:34.056
♪Streaking across the sky♪.

20:35.345 --> 20:36.744
I'll double-check with Huan'er.

20:36.905 --> 20:37.345
Okay.

20:37.345 --> 20:38.905
I wonder if she will live stream today.

20:45.744 --> 20:47.825
You're finally back.

20:48.385 --> 20:50.145
You've been looking for Gao Haiming.

20:50.345 --> 20:51.625
He's a character in a book.

20:51.625 --> 20:52.905
You won't find him.

20:53.984 --> 20:54.784
Xiaoyu.

20:55.945 --> 20:56.784
Let me tell you.

20:57.744 --> 20:59.145
Here in our world,

20:59.585 --> 21:00.984
there must be a Gao Haiming.

21:02.304 --> 21:03.304
And I will find him.

21:07.264 --> 21:08.905
Huan'er, are you going to live stream

21:08.905 --> 21:09.905
today?

21:13.464 --> 21:13.945
Yes.

21:15.585 --> 21:16.145
Really?

21:18.024 --> 21:18.784
Perfect!

21:18.784 --> 21:19.544
I'll go prepare.

21:27.304 --> 21:29.264
(Hello, I am back!)

21:29.385 --> 21:30.264
It's been a while.

21:30.264 --> 21:31.264
How have you been?

21:31.976 --> 21:33.352
(Ai Qing)

21:35.528 --> 21:36.502
(Ai Qing requests to join)

21:37.145 --> 21:39.905
(Tonight, we're talking about love.)

21:40.304 --> 21:42.064
Lin Huan'er, are you ready?

21:44.185 --> 21:45.544
Yes, let's just start.

21:46.064 --> 21:46.905
You sound

21:46.905 --> 21:48.784
so confident while talking big.

21:50.464 --> 21:51.848
I didn't understand it before.

21:52.865 --> 21:54.544
I thought love wasn't
anything important.

21:54.905 --> 21:56.425
And I never believed

21:57.145 --> 21:58.945
that there could be
someone in this world

21:59.625 --> 22:01.665
who gives it all to another
without asking rewards.

22:02.264 --> 22:05.304
We should be independent in life.

22:06.264 --> 22:07.905
We should live for ourselves.

22:08.625 --> 22:09.744
Thinking back now,

22:11.145 --> 22:12.145
I was too assertive.

22:12.665 --> 22:14.385
Actually, a proper love relationship

22:14.945 --> 22:16.145
makes you gentler

22:16.145 --> 22:17.145
and stronger.

22:17.704 --> 22:19.145
Love is all about who you are,

22:19.585 --> 22:20.905
not what I wish.

22:22.744 --> 22:24.464
Huan'er seems different.

22:28.185 --> 22:31.145
Huan'er, being so idealistic
will get you hurt.

22:31.744 --> 22:32.544
Sweeties,

22:33.385 --> 22:37.304
you must distinguish
between romance novels and reality.

22:37.744 --> 22:38.825
After reading

22:39.145 --> 22:40.704
romance novels,

22:41.185 --> 22:43.704
many people pursue romantic love.

22:44.224 --> 22:47.264
Those romantic plots
make you yearn for love.

22:48.145 --> 22:49.504
But love in reality?

22:50.385 --> 22:52.064
Those are toxic,

22:53.224 --> 22:55.264
will only let you be devoured by men.

22:57.024 --> 23:01.544
I once had an unforgettable love.

23:03.425 --> 23:04.504
That man...

23:04.945 --> 23:05.905
How to put it?

23:09.504 --> 23:11.064
He was a man from the last century,

23:11.585 --> 23:12.464
very old-style.

23:13.264 --> 23:14.544
At the very beginning,

23:14.984 --> 23:18.345
I used every trick
from 2025 to win him over,

23:20.385 --> 23:21.585
but they all failed.

23:23.704 --> 23:24.784
Until one day,

23:26.945 --> 23:27.984
I gave up the tricks,

23:29.744 --> 23:30.825
and started being sincere.

23:33.464 --> 23:35.544
That's when I won his love.

23:36.865 --> 23:38.905
Every second we spent together
was blissful.

23:39.905 --> 23:41.345
He took me to experience

23:42.385 --> 23:45.665
all the cliché plots
from old-style romance novels.

23:46.744 --> 23:48.064
But thinking back now,

23:49.704 --> 23:51.544
I realize I actually loved them.

23:53.825 --> 23:55.544
We can't see each other now,

23:56.304 --> 23:58.185
and we're not even
in the same time or space,

23:59.544 --> 24:00.784
but I still believe

24:01.704 --> 24:03.024
his love will always be there.

24:05.224 --> 24:06.585
So, true love

24:08.224 --> 24:10.145
comes when an unwavering heart

24:12.345 --> 24:14.345
meets another unwavering heart.

24:26.568 --> 24:33.416
(Monitor the house at a glance,
Control as you wish)

24:43.064 --> 24:44.464
Master, you're back.

24:44.984 --> 24:47.304
Today's weather is sunny to cloudy.

24:47.665 --> 24:50.145
Temperature is 19 to 22 degrees Celsius.

24:50.744 --> 24:52.704
How are you feeling today?

24:53.145 --> 24:55.264
What should I play for you?

24:55.984 --> 24:57.945
What would you like for dinner?

24:58.585 --> 25:01.224
Let me suggest some recipes.

25:01.704 --> 25:03.185
Handmade Wontons.

25:03.905 --> 25:05.264
Sweet and Sour Ribs.

25:05.865 --> 25:06.984
Crab Roe Tofu.

25:07.945 --> 25:09.064
Pine Nut Corn.

25:25.704 --> 25:29.264
(This is the only thing
brought back from that world.)

